    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "4178C1401BDFB386",
      "text": "Are you OK? You’re not hurt, are you?![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "4B28827826B0D7FE",
      "text": "I’m fine, honestly! Now get away from here—it’s\\nnot safe![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "4178C0401BDFB1D3",
      "text": "I’ll take over guarding the base, Riri! You should\\nget back inside![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_07",
      "hash64": "4B28837826B0D9B1",
      "text": "No. I won’t back down... I can’t![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "4178BF401BDFB020",
      "text": "Oh, Riri! You need to stop this![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_08",
      "hash64": "4B287C7826B0CDCC",
      "text": "Until the big boss comes back, I have to protect\\nall of you in the Caph Squad...\\c\\nAnd everyone else in Team Star, too.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "4178C6401BDFBC05",
      "text": "That’s why you should get back to the base and\\nrest up—even just for a little bit![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_09",
      "hash64": "4B287D7826B0CF7F",
      "text": "As the boss of this squad, I...I just can’t.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "4178C5401BDFBA52",
      "text": "Riri, please! I’m your friend! Listen to what\\nI’m saying![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
